; RUN: @iriec --target mos6502 --emit=asm @file

; Corpus: llvm-mos-reference/control-flow/nested-loop
; s += i * j over nested loops i < n, j < m.
;
; CHECK pins Irie's current --emit=asm output (characterization / golden).
; Compare against ext/llvm-mos-reference/control-flow/nested-loop.s; close gaps via irie-report.

